<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <title>About CineBook</title>

    <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.3/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css"
          rel="stylesheet">

    <style>
        body {
            background: #151515;
            color: #f5f5f5;
        }

        .navbar-custom {
            background: #0d0d0d;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #d4af37;
        }

        .brand {
            color: #d4af37;
            font-size: 24px;
            font-weight: bold;
        }

        .about-box {
            background: #202020;
            border: 1px solid #3a3a3a;
            border-radius: 18px;
            padding: 40px;
            margin-top: 50px;
        }

        h1 {
            color: #d4af37;
            font-weight: 700;
        }

        h3 {
            color: #d4af37;
            margin-top: 25px;
        }

        p {
            color: #cccccc;
            line-height: 1.7;
        }

        .btn-gold {
            background: #d4af37;
            color: #111;
            border: none;
            font-weight: 600;
        }

        .btn-gold:hover {
            background: #f0cc55;
            color: #111;
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>

<nav class="navbar navbar-custom">
    <div class="container">

        <span class="brand">🎬 CineBook</span>

        <a asp-action="Index"
           asp-controller="Cinema"
           class="btn btn-gold">
            Home
        </a>

    </div>
</nav>

<div class="container">

    <div class="about-box">

        <h1>About CineBook</h1>

        <p class="lead">
            Welcome to CineBook, a simple Cinema Ticket Booking System
            developed using ASP.NET Core MVC.
        </p>

        <h3>What can you do?</h3>

        <p>
            Customers can view available movies, book movie tickets,
            view booking information, and check the total ticket amount.
        </p>

        <h3>Features</h3>

        <p>
            • Movie ticket booking<br>
            • Customer information<br>
            • Movie details<br>
            • Booking status<br>
            • Total ticket amount in Indian Rupees<br>
            • Bootstrap-based responsive interface
        </p>

        <a asp-action="Index"
           asp-controller="Cinema"
           class="btn btn-gold mt-3">
            Back to Home
        </a>

    </div>

</div>

</body>
</html>